WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:05.810
Hey.

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:06.740
You're in early.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.970
Yeah, I couldn't sleep.

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:09.950
The damn leg cramps.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:13.592
When you get your coffee, meet me in holding three.

00:00:13.592 --> 00:00:14.092
Three?

00:00:50.292 --> 00:00:51.000
Want some coffee?

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:55.715
What are you doing?

00:00:55.715 --> 00:00:57.870
I want to see her.

00:00:57.870 --> 00:00:59.910
No, Sheriff.

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:04.090
Should have done it three years ago, but I couldn't listen.

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:07.370
Hey, stop.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:13.490
Come-- come on out of there, and let's talk about this.

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:16.170
I made up my mind or I wouldn't be in here.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:18.930
I'm sorry, Sam.

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.960
You're going to say this to me after all we've been through?

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:23.560
I'm going to wait till Sandy gets in.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:28.350
I don't want you to say it.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:32.570
Please, Sheriff, don't say it.

